        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Albert Heijn\n- Companies: Ahold, Delhaize Group, Ahold Delhaize\n- Places: Zaandam, Hereford, Netherlands\n- Roles: entrepreneur, stock holder, founder, chairman of the board, retailer\n\nFacts:\n- Albert Heijn was born in Zaandam on 25 January 1927.\n- Albert Heijn was a Dutch entrepreneur, a major stock holder, and the founder and chairman of the board of Ahold.\n- Koninklijke Ahold N.V. was a Dutch international retailer based in Zaandam, Netherlands.\n- Albert Heijn died in Hereford on 13 January 2011.\n- In 2016, Ahold merged with Delhaize Group to form Ahold Delhaize.",
